From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] glm5next: split-block Marlin W4A16 MoE prefill

VLLM_GLM5_PP_MARLIN_PREFILL (default 0 = unchanged), _MIN_TOKENS (384).
Morrowmake's split-block schedule: routed rows are aligned into 64/48/32/16
row block lists (cheapest cover per expert) and each list is one stock
Marlin launch. Gate: sm_80, E=288, top-8, K=4096, N=2048, uint4b8 g128,
bf16, no expert map or LoRA. Not bitwise equal to fused_marlin_moe
(stream-K split).

